22:00.010 --> 22:01.800
Are you guys all right?

22:03.780 --> 22:04.670
Well, yeah.

22:04.670 --> 22:06.300
I'm used to it.

22:06.300 --> 22:08.280
Are you guys free right now?

22:08.280 --> 22:10.300
Yeah, pretty much.

22:10.760 --> 22:12.300
Cod roe lips.

22:13.080 --> 22:14.440
Ugly glasses.

22:14.890 --> 22:16.310
Fox raccoon.

22:17.300 --> 22:18.810
I'm not interested.

22:19.270 --> 22:23.820
If you guys have some free time, do you guys want to shoot off some fireworks with us?

22:25.180 --> 22:26.200
W-Who?

22:26.200 --> 22:27.180
Who?

22:27.180 --> 22:27.930
Us?

22:29.110 --> 22:33.830
Nanjou-san got picked up by good looking guys.

22:34.380 --> 22:36.560
It's fine if you guys don't want to.

22:37.670 --> 22:38.940
We will.

22:41.840 --> 22:44.260
Hey, what's with that?

22:45.820 --> 22:47.690
Blaze dance!

22:48.260 --> 22:50.010
Who wants shaved ice?!

22:50.950 --> 22:52.200
I do!

22:53.740 --> 22:54.960
And then...

22:54.960 --> 22:56.770
Yep, yep, you're right.

22:57.120 --> 22:57.810
This.

22:57.810 --> 22:58.980
Awesome.

23:01.860 --> 23:03.730
They're all doing good.

23:04.580 --> 23:07.240
Take... this!

23:08.490 --> 23:10.200
No, no, hey...

23:12.640 --> 23:14.210
That scared me.

23:15.430 --> 23:16.490
I'm sorry.

23:16.490 --> 23:17.540
Not at all...

23:27.470 --> 23:29.090
I'm jealous of Umisho.

23:29.090 --> 23:33.110
Our team is a single-person team with Nanjou-san, so it's suffocating.

23:33.110 --> 23:40.070
No, our team looks nice, but behind the scenes, a demon woman is leading us.

23:40.070 --> 23:41.400
Really?

23:42.790 --> 23:44.330
You're the same, huh?

23:44.330 --> 23:45.650
The same, the same.

23:46.410 --> 23:47.430
Then...

23:48.870 --> 23:52.370
we're in the same situation, so let's do our best.

23:53.310 --> 23:55.080
This is weird.

23:55.840 --> 24:00.080
This girl is starting to look cute.

24:00.830 --> 24:02.460
I see!

24:03.330 --> 24:10.530
I met you in my previous existence as well...

24:11.490 --> 24:12.590
There he is!

24:14.470 --> 24:16.880
Officer, it's those three!

24:16.880 --> 24:19.370
They tried to kidnap my daughter!

24:19.370 --> 24:20.100
What?!

24:20.970 --> 24:22.990
You're mistaken!

24:22.990 --> 24:25.610
I was just trying to pick her up!

24:25.610 --> 24:26.670
No way!

24:26.670 --> 24:28.650
You tried picking up a girl that small?!

24:29.470 --> 24:30.320
No...

24:33.760 --> 24:36.080
You guys are telling me the whole story at the station.

24:36.430 --> 24:37.280
Let's go.

24:40.220 --> 24:43.750
Our summer night's dream was wasted...

24:45.960 --> 24:48.630
It's finally the Kantou tournament,

24:48.630 --> 24:52.510
but before that, we have to rest our bodies in the open-air baths.

24:53.470 --> 24:56.850
Something incredible is going on in the women's baths.

24:57.320 --> 24:58.810
I want to find out.

24:58.810 --> 25:00.470
I want to see.

25:05.090 --> 25:08.890
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho:

25:08.890 --> 25:11.060
"Could it be..."

25:11.060 --> 25:15.070
I will comfort you tonight.
